flowchart TD
  I["Image · B × H × W × C"] --> P["Shared patch projection<br/>B × N × D"]
  P --> C["Prepend CLS and add position<br/>B × (N+1) × D"]
  C --> A["LN → global MSA → residual"]
  A --> F["LN → GELU MLP → residual"]
  F --> L["Repeat L blocks · final LN"]
  L --> R["CLS · B × D"]
  L --> V["Patch features · B × N × D"]
  R --> H["Classification head"]
  V --> X["External VLM projector<br/>not part of original ViT"]
